    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32083" root="غطو and غطى" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غِطَايَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A thing, of the stuffing of clothes, with
which a woman has covered herself,</i> (K, TA,)
<i>beneath her clothes,</i> (TA,) <i>such as the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غِلَالَة</span> [q. v.]
<i>and the like:</i> (K, TA:) [it is said that] the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ى</span>
therein is substituted for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span>. (TA.)

